# .mailmap - Maps commit authors to canonical names/emails
# This prevents GitHub from incorrectly detecting "claude" as a contributor

# Map all variations of your identity to a single canonical name
bgengs <bgengs@gmail.com> Bernie Gengel <berniegengel@gmail.com>
bgengs <bgengs@gmail.com> bgengs <bgengs@gmail.com>

# Exclude claude from contributor detection (API references, not actual contributor)
# GitHub sometimes picks up "claude" from file contents as a false contributor 